Z||000015||gixxer||10-31-2000||12:06 AM||||Dang BigTurbo! You really don't wanna take that pan off, eh?<BR>I will soon be receiving the Design 1 turbo kit. It returns the turbo drain oil to the pan.<BR>Unless you use some kind of scavenge pump, on the outlet, you'll have to drain it to the pan too. ||||reg||1
